195
10:59.230 --> 11:00.600
Get what fucking grip?!

196
11:01.690 --> 11:03.560
Your boy shoved mine into the pool!

197
11:16.460 --> 11:17.780
We're fucked...

198
11:18.180 --> 11:19.480
Then... Then, we'll take our leave.

199
11:20.200 --> 11:21.070
Goodbye.

200
11:21.390 --> 11:22.180
Go.

201
11:32.100 --> 11:33.180
I didn't do it.

202
11:36.410 --> 11:37.690
Uh... Tae,

203
11:37.710 --> 11:39.240
I think you should leave for now.

204
11:54.180 --> 11:55.580
I'm gonna find out who did this.

205
11:59.670 --> 12:00.400
Chamook,

206
12:01.890 --> 12:03.290
