207
12:03.310 --> 12:04.550
I'll take care of those two first.

208
12:04.680 --> 12:05.560
- Go. - Alright.

209
12:06.820 --> 12:08.240
Sir, what happened?

210
12:08.520 --> 12:09.960
How did that video end up there? And...

211
12:10.300 --> 12:11.620
where did you get the file?

212
12:11.640 --> 12:13.120
The files have the same name.

213
12:13.240 --> 12:14.550
I don't know who did it, either.

214
12:14.610 --> 12:15.800
Wait, that's not gonna cut it!

215
12:16.360 --> 12:18.080
And who's gonna pay for this?

216
12:19.990 --> 12:21.680
Then, may I look at the security footage?

217
12:21.750 --> 12:23.080
There are no security cameras in this zone,

218
12:23.360 --> 12:24.040
but...

219
12:24.110 --> 12:26.680
I will look into what happened.

220
12:28.220 --> 12:29.640
You played the video, right?

221
12:29.820 --> 12:31.040
I did,

222
12:31.330 --> 12:33.120
but I reviewed the file earlier.

223
12:33.460 --> 12:35.570
The file names were actually the same,

224
12:35.590 --> 12:37.160
but not what was inside.

225
12:37.400 --> 12:39.240
The new kid gave me the file to play.

226
12:40.030 --> 12:40.960
The new kid?

227
12:41.040 --> 12:42.860
And where did they get this file, sir?

228
12:42.880 --> 12:45.070
And where's the kid, sir?

229
12:46.300 --> 12:47.300
Where's Co?!

230
12:48.120 --> 12:51.090
I haven't seen them for a while, either.

231
12:52.600 --> 12:53.250
Wait, like...

232
12:53.270 --> 12:55.520
you didn't even look into the new kid you brought in to work?

233
12:56.290 --> 12:57.390
May I look at their profile?

234
12:57.410 --> 12:58.300
Name, address,

235
12:58.320 --> 12:59.790
are those on their application form?

236
13:00.040 --> 13:00.840
No.

237
13:01.240 --> 13:02.480
They just started yesterday

238
13:02.930 --> 13:05.800
and said they would turn the documents in tomorrow.

239
13:05.920 --> 13:07.880
You seriously brought the new hire on board like that?

240
13:09.280 --> 13:11.080
That's on the staff.

241
13:11.780 --> 13:12.720
I don't think...

242
13:13.170 --> 13:14.520
we should interfere with others' duties.

243
13:14.540 --> 13:15.880
- Hey, you can't say that... - Uh...

244
13:16.630 --> 13:17.430
we're sorry.

245
13:17.450 --> 13:19.240
- Hey, why are you saying sorry? - Nine.

246
13:19.920 --> 13:21.190
No... we have to take this further, Mama!

247
13:21.210 --> 13:22.000
Listen.

248
13:23.180 --> 13:24.180
We're sorry.

249
13:25.000 --> 13:26.080
Third, Nine, let's head home.

250
13:36.760 --> 13:38.280
Yes, you can come now.

251
13:41.760 --> 13:43.360
Let's go, come on. Quick.

252
13:43.380 --> 13:44.520
Quick, let's go, let's go.

253
13:52.230 --> 13:54.030
Go, go, get in the van.

254
14:08.110 --> 14:08.860
Here.

255
14:08.880 --> 14:09.600
Head home.

256
14:10.340 --> 14:11.320
No, Mama,

257
14:12.650 --> 14:14.290
not until I know who leaked the video.

258
14:14.700 --> 14:16.100
If we let this go today, Mama,

259
14:16.120 --> 14:17.160
we'll never find out who.

260
14:18.610 --> 14:19.990
It's about the video, no?

261
14:20.010 --> 14:22.350
- Not the person who did it. - Exactly!

262
14:22.380 --> 14:23.320
Calm down.

263
14:23.420 --> 14:24.760
You're not listening to me.

264
14:25.300 --> 14:26.000
Nine,

265
14:26.260 --> 14:27.290
don't lie.

266
14:27.690 --> 14:28.840
Fucking lie about what?

267
14:29.130 --> 14:30.920
I was with you all day, Third.

268
14:32.050 --> 14:33.880
You seem to want me to believe you're an angel, huh?

269
14:33.900 --> 14:35.250
What fucking angel?!

270
14:35.680 --> 14:37.480
I'm not doing this 'cause I wanna be an angel!

271
14:37.500 --> 14:38.340
Here we go,

272
14:38.920 --> 14:39.960
