273
14:41.320 --> 14:42.320
How about you cut it out?

274
14:43.210 --> 14:45.920
It's already gotten out of hand, so why the hell are you fighting?

275
14:47.440 --> 14:48.100
Third,

276
14:48.750 --> 14:50.240
