277
14:50.420 --> 14:53.080
Can't you tell that he's being honest this time?

278
14:53.590 --> 14:54.900
I really didn't do it, Third.

279
14:56.500 --> 14:57.680
What will I get out of this?

280
14:57.990 --> 14:59.480
Slandering Wan, of course.

281
15:00.000 --> 15:02.440
Then you can act all angelic and fucking innocent in all this.

282
15:02.460 --> 15:04.480
In case you forget, I was with you when it went down.

283
15:04.500 --> 15:05.640
You could've asked someone to do it,

284
15:06.000 --> 15:07.940
