298
15:34.810 --> 15:36.200
Another new act of yours?

299
15:37.690 --> 15:38.840
Whatever.

300
15:38.960 --> 15:40.440
If you're gonna get in my way like this...

301
15:41.350 --> 15:41.960
Mama,

302
15:41.980 --> 15:42.970
