303
15:42.990 --> 15:44.200
What the fuck does it have to do with Susan?

304
15:44.220 --> 15:45.640
Well, Susan took the video.

305
15:45.800 --> 15:46.920
She told me herself.

306
15:47.800 --> 15:49.580
So that means you have the video?

307
15:50.380 --> 15:51.490
I don't.

308
15:51.900 --> 15:53.280
She didn't forward it to me.

309
15:54.340 --> 15:55.440
Mama, give her a call.

310
15:57.410 --> 15:58.180
Hello,

311
15:59.370 --> 16:00.670
where are you and Rin?

312
16:01.890 --> 16:02.560
Okay.

313
16:02.990 --> 16:04.890
Then you two meet me at the company.

314
16:11.200 --> 16:12.460
I didn't leak the video.

315
16:14.900 --> 16:16.040
I didn't, either.

316
16:16.540 --> 16:19.080
I stand, sit, and lie by my words.

317
16:20.020 --> 16:22.600
Take out your phones, both of you.

318
16:23.270 --> 16:25.360
I already said I didn't leak it. Why do you need it?

319
16:25.540 --> 16:26.680
I have to check.

320
16:27.230 --> 16:28.670
If you really didn't,

321
16:28.690 --> 16:30.390
then you should be able to show me, no?

322
16:30.410 --> 16:31.000
Hey, but...

323
16:31.230 --> 16:32.400
Isn't this too over the top?

324
16:32.500 --> 16:33.890
Want it to be a bigger deal than it is?

325
16:33.910 --> 16:35.080
Nine told me

326
16:35.410 --> 16:36.990
