473
23:07.730 --> 23:09.300
Don't worry, girlie.

474
23:10.910 --> 23:12.390
Thank you, girlie.

475
23:31.110 --> 23:32.200
Here's your cocoa, babe.

476
23:37.480 --> 23:38.400
Thank you.

477
23:55.890 --> 23:57.720
Wan looked so stressed out last night.

478
23:58.080 --> 23:59.360
