602
32:53.140 --> 32:54.530
I'm the fucking worst.

603
32:54.840 --> 32:56.730
I don't deserve to be here with you, Juno.

604
32:59.720 --> 33:01.350
Just go fucking die, then.

605
33:01.710 --> 33:04.200
Go rot in whatever hell you want.

606
33:04.540 --> 33:05.630
I don't fucking care.

607
33:07.520 --> 33:08.310
Nine,

608
33:08.920 --> 33:10.250
just wanna say

609
33:10.280 --> 33:13.020
Mama's taken care of the journalists for you.

